              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gönkaaga ya Bheka ömögambi wa Isiraeri, Tigirati-bhireseri, ömögambi wa Asuru, naamerri imigi ge: Iyoni, Abheri-bheti-maaka, Yanoa, Katesi, na Hasori, hamui na ichinsë cha Gireati, Gariraya na Nabhutari na akaimukia abhantö bhaacho ubhunyambu kuya Asuru.",
